// The API answers in ENGLISH (HTTPException details, gemini.py:interpretar_erro_gemini, ...), but what it STORED before the English
// switch (extraction errors, RFI error justifications, default titles) is pt-BR, and background tasks have no request language. So the
// UI translates the KNOWN messages at display time, from whichever of the three languages they were written in to the one on screen,
// and leaves anything it does not recognise (raw Gemini details, text generated by the AI) exactly as received. Keep this table in
// sync with the strings in api/app (HTTPException details, gemini.py:interpretar_erro_gemini, rfi/service.py:_JUSTIFICATIVA_ERRO,
// recuperacao.py:MENSAGEM_REINICIO): a new backend message simply shows up in English until it is added here.
